From 51f7bf529ddf7efa85e845e22325d14a2bc49a10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gambtho <Thomas.Gamble@microsoft.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 21:52:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] app: electron: Register OAuth callback providers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Route validated product protocol callbacks to their owning OAuth provider so
desktop integrations can complete authentication safely.

Co-authored-by: René Dudfield <renedudfield@microsoft.com>
